{"seq":1,"slug":"overfitting-nnpu","title":"nnPU 的过拟合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/challenges/overfitting-nnpu","wordCount":1641,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"nnpu-的过拟合\">nnPU 的过拟合</h1><p><a href=\"../methods/risk-estimation\">风险估计</a> 一篇里，nnPU 用一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(0,\\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 堵住了 uPU「刷负风险」的漏洞，看似把训练稳定住了。但把它真正部署到高容量网络、长时间训练时，工程师常撞见一个更隐蔽的现象：训练损失平稳、非负修正也在正常触发，验证 AUC 却在若干 epoch 后悄悄掉头向下。nnPU 修好了 uPU 那种灾难式崩溃，却没有根除过拟合，只是把它变得更温和、更难察觉。本篇专门解剖这层过拟合：它从哪来、怎么诊断、Kiryo 原论文与近年的缓解手段各是什么。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-非负修正为何不彻底\">核心概念：非负修正为何不彻底</h2><p>先厘清两种过拟合。uPU 的过拟合是<strong>发散式</strong>的：负例风险项被估成负数，总风险可无下界地降，模型朝一个数学上没意义的方向狂奔，验证性能断崖式崩塌。nnPU 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(0,\\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 把这项钳在非负，堵死了发散通道——这是它的功劳。但钳制只保证「风险项不为负」，并不保证「模型不记忆训练样本」。当正例池 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 较小、模型容量很大时，网络依然可以记住每一个已标注正例的细节，只是这次它的过拟合表现为正常的、渐进的泛化下降，而非发散。换句话说，nnPU 把一个<strong>病理性</strong>问题降级成了一个<strong>普通但仍存在</strong>的问题。</p>\n<p>更麻烦的是 PU 特有的放大因素：训练信号里，未标注池 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 中的隐藏正例被当作「判负」的目标在拉扯模型（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_u^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0183em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 项），而它们本该是正。模型越强，越能把已标注正例与这些「被当负例的隐藏正例」硬生生分开——代价是学到虚假的、只对训练集成立的边界。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 越小、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 里隐藏正例比例（即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）越高，这种拉扯越严重。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[高容量模型 + 小正例池 P] --&gt; B[uPU 负例风险项估成负数]&#10;  B --&gt; C[发散式过拟合&lt;br/&gt;验证性能断崖崩塌]&#10;  A --&gt; D[nnPU max 钳制非负]&#10;  D --&gt; E[堵住发散通道]&#10;  E --&gt; F{仍会记忆 P + 硬分隐藏正例}&#10;  F --&gt; G[温和渐进过拟合&lt;br/&gt;验证 AUC 悄悄下滑]&#10;  G --&gt; H[缓解: 梯度回拉 / 早停 / 正则 / 方差约束]\">graph TD\n  A[高容量模型 + 小正例池 P] --&gt; B[uPU 负例风险项估成负数]\n  B --&gt; C[发散式过拟合&lt;br/&gt;验证性能断崖崩塌]\n  A --&gt; D[nnPU max 钳制非负]\n  D --&gt; E[堵住发散通道]\n  E --&gt; F{仍会记忆 P + 硬分隐藏正例}\n  F --&gt; G[温和渐进过拟合&lt;br/&gt;验证 AUC 悄悄下滑]\n  G --&gt; H[缓解: 梯度回拉 / 早停 / 正则 / 方差约束]</pre><h2 id=\"诊断-如何看见这层过拟合\">诊断：如何看见这层过拟合</h2><p>难点是没有真负例做验证集，标准的「看验证损失」在 PU 里不直接可用（评估本身是难题，见 <a href=\"../practice/pu-evaluation\">PU 评估</a>）。几个可操作的诊断信号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>监控非负项的触发频率</strong>。统计每个 epoch 里有多少 mini-batch 触发了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 的钳制（即括号内本要变负）。触发率从偶发升到频繁，是模型开始过拟合正例的早期信号。</li>\n<li><strong>留出带标签的小验证集</strong>。哪怕只标几百个真负例，也能算出可信的验证 AUC / F1，用它做早停。这点小标注投入回报极高，是实践里最推荐的做法。</li>\n<li><strong>用 PU 版验证准则</strong>。在纯 PU 数据上，用 Lee-Liu 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>recall</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{recall}^2/P(\\hat y=1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1484em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">recall</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 这类可估准则做验证曲线，找它的峰值 epoch，详见 <a href=\"../practice/pu-evaluation\">PU 评估</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>观察正例池召回</strong>。若模型在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 上的召回接近 100% 而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 的判正率持续攀升，往往是在无脑扩大正类，需警惕。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"kiryo-原论文的两个旋钮\">Kiryo 原论文的两个旋钮</h2><p>nnPU 论文（NeurIPS 2017）本身就带了对抗过拟合的机制，对应 <a href=\"../methods/risk-estimation\">风险估计</a> 里伪代码的两个参数：</p>\n<p><strong>梯度回拉（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>）</strong>。当某 batch 的负例风险项要变负，不做梯度下降，而是沿该负项做步长乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma\\in(0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 的梯度<strong>上升</strong>，把模型往「别再过拟合这批」的方向推。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 小则回拉温和、训练平滑但纠偏慢；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 大则纠偏强但可能震荡。它相当于一个数据驱动的自适应刹车。</p>\n<p><strong>负容忍 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></strong>。允许负例风险项轻微为负（到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>）才触发回拉，给数值波动留缓冲，避免因 mini-batch 噪声频繁误触发。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 通常取一个接近 0 的小正数。</p>\n<p>这两个旋钮加上适度的 mini-batch 尺寸（太小会让风险项估计方差大、频繁误触发钳制）构成 nnPU 稳定训练的基本配置。下表给出典型症状到旋钮的对应。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>可能原因</th>\n<th>调整方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>验证 AUC 早期即下滑</td>\n<td>正则不足、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 太小</td>\n<td>增强 weight decay / dropout，早停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练剧烈震荡</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 太大、batch 太小</td>\n<td>减小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>、增大 batch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钳制几乎不触发但仍过拟合</td>\n<td>模型容量过大</td>\n<td>缩小模型、加正则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钳制频繁误触发</td>\n<td>batch 噪声大、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 太小</td>\n<td>增大 batch、略增 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"近年的缓解变体\">近年的缓解变体</h2><p>nnPU 之后，研究界从几个方向继续压过拟合。<strong>方差 / 一致性约束</strong>：给风险估计加正则，抑制其在 mini-batch 间的高方差，减少虚假边界。<strong>自校正去噪</strong>：把「被当负例的隐藏正例」显式当作标签噪声处理，用样本自校正、噪声负样本纠偏（如 2023 年 arXiv:2308.00279 的噪声负样本自校正、2025 年 arXiv:2510.01278 的噪声对鲁棒表示对齐）迭代净化训练信号。<strong>正则化 uPU（如加惩罚项而非硬钳制）</strong>：用软性惩罚替代 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 的硬拐点，让优化更平滑。<strong>表示对齐 / 对比学习</strong>：先学一个把正类聚拢的表示空间，再在其上做 PU 分类，让隐藏正例天然靠近已标注正例，减轻硬分拉扯。这些方法与经典 nnPU 通常兼容，可叠加使用。</p>\n<p>需要提醒：这些变体大多在特定数据集上取得增益，尚无一个能像 nnPU 那样成为无争议默认。工程落地时，先把「小验证集早停 + 适度正则 + 合理 batch」这三件基础做扎实，往往已解决大部分过拟合；再考虑上更复杂的变体。落地取舍见 <a href=\"../practice/pu-in-practice\">PU 落地与边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>nnPU 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 只堵住了 uPU 的发散式过拟合，未根除普通的记忆式过拟合；表现为验证 AUC 温和渐进下滑，比 uPU 崩溃更隐蔽。</li>\n<li>PU 特有放大因素：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 中隐藏正例被当负例拉扯模型，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 越小、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越高越严重。</li>\n<li>诊断靠监控钳制触发频率、留出带标签小验证集、PU 版验证准则、观察正例召回。</li>\n<li>缓解手段分层：先用 Kiryo 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 旋钮 + 早停 + 正则 + 合理 batch 打底，再视需要叠加方差约束、自校正去噪、表示对齐等近年变体。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>过拟合的数学根源：<a href=\"../methods/risk-estimation\">风险估计 uPU/nnPU</a></li>\n<li>无负例下如何做验证 / 早停：<a href=\"../practice/pu-evaluation\">PU 评估</a></li>\n<li>先验估偏也会加剧问题：<a href=\"../methods/class-prior\">类先验估计</a></li>\n<li>落地时的取舍顺序：<a href=\"../practice/pu-in-practice\">PU 落地与边界</a></li>\n<li>跨库对照——同为「记忆式过拟合」的少数类：<a href=\"../../imbalanced-learning-resampling/practice/resampling-pitfalls\">重采样的陷阱</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"nnPU 的过拟合","id":"nnpu-的过拟合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：非负修正为何不彻底","id":"核心概念-非负修正为何不彻底"},{"level":2,"text":"诊断：如何看见这层过拟合","id":"诊断-如何看见这层过拟合"},{"level":2,"text":"Kiryo 原论文的两个旋钮","id":"kiryo-原论文的两个旋钮"},{"level":2,"text":"近年的缓解变体","id":"近年的缓解变体"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"类先验估计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/methods/class-prior"},"next":{"title":"先验偏移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/challenges/prior-shift"}}